# Only the pages, the config and the Linux package signing key are tracked.
# Everything else here is what scripts/publish-release.sh drops in to
# deploy from this Mac: SHA256SUMS from dist-release/<version>/, the
# repository's THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES renamed to .txt, and the apt and dnf
# metadata under linux/. The DMG itself is an asset on the mirror's GitHub
# release, and binaries have no business in the repository's history.
*
!.gitignore
!index.html
!download.html
!vercel.json
!linux/
linux/*
!linux/index.html
!linux/readily.repo
!linux/readily.asc
.vercel
.env*
